  "student_passage": "On Saturday, Nia helps her father at a small shop. They (1) ____ the shop at nine. Before customers arrive, Nia puts paper bags on the shelf. The shelf is (2) ____ at first, with nothing on it.\n\nA customer buys a glass bowl. Nia checks the bowl (3) ____ for cracks before she puts it down. She puts it in a bag and places the bag on the counter. Her father is happy: “You are never (4) ____ for work. You always arrive before nine.” At noon, there are no customers. There is no music and no one is talking. The shop is very (5) ____. Nia and her father can hear the clock. They eat lunch together.\n\n词库：A. quiet　B. loudly　C. open　D. carefully　E. empty　F. late（有一项不用）",
